Package: com.duoface.carplay.nativescenehost
Name: DuoFace Native Dashboard Scene Host (Development)
Version: 0.0.7~cpbar1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Section: Development
Maintainer: DuoFace Independent
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0)
Description: Independent Native12-inspired basic split chrome test inside system-issued CarPlay CPWindow. Two empty slots; CarPlay template bar controls App/Zoom/Style/Close and map buttons for 33/67 ratio and swap. Custom UIKit pane touch/drag is not supported by CPWindow. No external app hosting yet, no vendor code, no Dock override, no automatic respring.
